  "description": "You use the bike as an expression of yourself, and likewise, nothing \"off-the-shelf\" will do. That's why we reached out to a longtime Specialized designer, Rodney Hines, to impart his artistic vision upon the Artist Edition of the S-Works Shiv Module. The S-Works Shiv Module is the ultimate speed weapon for any triathlon distance, and it's specifically designed to take your bike leg to the next level. Its frame is constructed from our top of the line FACT 11r carbon, and it features crosswind-optimized airfoils. Additionally, with the Control Tower Fit System, you're guaranteed a wide fit range, while our Fuelselage Hydration System offers integrated hydration solutions for both training and racing. So it's safe to say that this bike is as versatile as it is performance-minded, or in other words, the S-Works Shiv Module is the perfect canvas to start painting your dream triathlon rig with. S-Works FACT 11r carbon frame is made with our highest quality construction methods and features crosswind-optimized airfoils for enhanced aerodynamics. Meanwhile, the Control Tower Fit System and Fuelselage Hydration System ensure that your fit and hydration are always optimized.",
